<title>AUSTRIA: Austria issues 20 blon ats, 5-yr 4.375 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Austria issues 20 blon ats, 5-yr 4.375 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria has issued a 20 billion schillings, five-year 4.375 percent bond with a maximum yield of 4.63 percent, the Austrian Kontrollbank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The issue price was 100 percent and the average yield 4.375 percent. The bond will mature on February 28, 2002. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
